    "faq_tab_accordion_1_G3DWhA": {
      "type": "faq_tab_accordion_1",
      "blocks": {
        "text_JaTjtj": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "ques": "What is a mint nicotine pouch?",
            "ans": "<p>A mint nicotine pouch is a small, tobacco-free pouch packed with nicotine and cool, refreshing mint flavour. You pop it under your upper lip and let it work its magic—no smoke, no tobacco.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_4aVx9q": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "ques": "What mint flavours do you have in your nicotine pouches?",
            "ans": "<p>Our mint nicotine pouches collection brings you all the fresh flavour you could want. Choose from sweet <a href=\"https://ubbspouches.com/products/spearmint\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Spearmint</span></a>, the icy blast of <a href=\"https://ubbspouches.com/products/menthol\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Menthol</span></a>, or the bold sharpness of <a href=\"https://ubbspouches.com/products/peppermint\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Peppermint</span></a>. Each flavour is crafted to keep things fresh without any bitter or artificial aftertaste. Just cool mint satisfaction in every pouch.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_xVfGQj": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "ques": "What makes your mint nicotine pouches stand out?",
            "ans": "<p>Our mint nicotine pouches are smooth, cooling, and completely tobacco-free. Made to pharmaceutical-grade standards, each pouch delivers a consistent nicotine release and a flavour that stays crisp from start to finish. Whether you're after a subtle chill or an icy blast, these mint nicotine pouch collections bring freshness without the fuss.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_ePGqpN": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "ques": "Are cool mint flavoured nicotine pouches beginner-friendly?",
            "ans": "<p>Absolutely. Cool mint flavoured nicotine pouches are a go-to for first-timers. The fresh, familiar taste makes them easy to enjoy, and they’re available in a range of strengths to help you find your sweet spot. We recommend starting with Regular (6mg) if you're new to mint pouches.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_fDta4K": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "ques": "What nicotine strengths are available in mint pouches?",
            "ans": "<p>Our mint pouches come in a range of strengths to suit all preferences. You’ll find Regular (6mg), and Strong (11mg) across most flavours, with Max (14mg) available in the <a href=\"https://ubbspouches.com/products/menthol\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Menthol</span></a> flavour for those who like a more intense experience. Whether you're easing in or looking for a stronger option, there’s a mint pouch to match your routine.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_HB9hHp": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "ques": "Which mint nicotine pouch is the most popular?",
            "ans": "<p><a href=\"https://ubbspouches.com/products/peppermint\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Peppermint</span></a> is one of our top sellers: clean, classic and refreshing with just the right amount of tingle. Whichever you pick, you’re getting some of the freshest mint-flavoured nicotine pouches available.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_TQj8mY": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "ques": "How do mint nicotine pouches compare to other flavours?",
            "ans": "<p>Mint pouches offer a fresher, sharper experience than <a href=\"https://ubbspouches.com/collections/fruit-flavours\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">fruity</span></a> or sweet flavours. If you prefer something refreshing and less sweet, mint is a great shout. They’re especially popular for their crisp taste, cooling effect and how well they pair with everything—coffee, work, nights out, you name it.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
